- #2 Make yourself unbeatable first; win then seek battle: build the verifier first. For a script, if you can't build `verify.sh`, it's not yet a script. This is directly in the facts: procedure-to-skill turns procedure into scripts/procedure.sh plus scripts/verify.sh. So the test: can you write a verification? If the outcome can't be checked, it cannot be a script (should be a page).
